Well, angelic beings generally wield rustproof longswords (usually
enchanted to +1 or +2), including the artifacts Sunsword and Demonbane
(which are longswords, of course), so perhaps you picked one of these
up.  I've never seen them generated with any armor except a shield of
reflection in the Astral plane, but this is, by definition, fooproof
already.  The only other rustproof item I can think of is the
rustproof splintmail you may find on the rogue level (where the ghost
is located).  This is too heavy to be effective armor for me, however.

As for protection from rust, corrosion, fire, etc., I've noticed that
if an item is blessed, it has a small chance of avoiding damage from
such sources (when the item is not fooproof).

